   R4: with the chosen Cc2 the loop meets PM >= 50 deg, GM >= 10 dB, |1+T| >= 0.5, every crossover ceiling and the impedance bound over the whole cold envelope, Cc2's tolerance and the mixed banks, at R12 12 mOhm, loads to the highest permitted current, default and widened bands: yes
